# wmdemo namespace manifest (docs/USERSPACE_v2.md UP4).
# A self-contained EmUI app: it draws from the UI runtime (fonts + libembk.so +
# images) under the sealed, read-only /system and owns a window (a GPU
# capability, not a name). It does NO file I/O of its own, so it runs with a
# narrow, read-only view of /system and cannot name /data, /run, or a home.
ro /system
